# Helper scripts, symbol and footprint libraries, and complete KiCad projects or templates.

# For PCBs designed using KiCad: https://www.kicad.org/
# Format documentation: https://kicad.org/help/file-formats/
# Scoped to currently supported KiCad. Pre-6 artifacts are not generated any more and have
# been dropped: *.000, *.bck, *-cache* (the v5 symbol cache), *.kicad_pcb-bak and
# *.kicad_sch-bak (superseded by *-backups/*.zip), *-bak, *-bak*, _autosave-*,
# \#auto_saved_files\#, *-save.pro and *-save.kicad_pcb (.pro was the v5 project format).

# Temporary and lock files
*.bak
*.tmp
*~
~*
~*.lck
fp-info-cache

# Backups and local history
*-backups
**/*-backups/*.zip
_restore_backup_*/
.history

# Netlist files (exported from Eeschema)
*.net

# Autorouter files (exported from Pcbnew)
*.dsn
*.ses

# Exported BOM files. Off here: this repo also holds scripts and libraries whose own data
# files use these extensions, and a pattern hiding a file you meant to add gives no warning.
#*.xml
#*.csv

# Local project settings
*.kicad_prl

# Python helper scripts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# OS
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
